I am a Computer Science Ph.D. student at Texas State University, advised by Dr. Chul-Ho Lee ([https://sites.google.com/site/chulholeesite/ website]). My research focuses on *Machine Learning Systems (MLSys)* and *Graph Neural Networks (GNNs)*.

